WEBVTT

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:38.530
Mission log, day 1, 21:32.

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.950
Day 1, 21:32

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:39.970
Log entry by

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:43.030
Incognito's 3rd division 
commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:46.160
4 hours 38 minutes since the 
end of the previous mission.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.330
Target Alpha and target Bravo are

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:50.560
moving north after the 
end of the battle.

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:03.170
22:12.

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:05.060
Day 1, 22:12

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:07.830
The targets arrive at Marquesas, 
a town of 5700 people.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:21.740
22:48, they move to an inn.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:21.740
 22:48

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:27.120
We let money do the talking and rented

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.990
a room in the building 
across from the inn.

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:33.500
Using that as our base, 
we are observing the targets.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.510
For now, there is nothing to note.

00:02:37.310 --> 00:02:38.950
We will continue our observation.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:42.880
I proposed this action
 to Erec-sama myself

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:44.720
and received his blessing.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.720
The showdown with DT...

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.900
After the countless clashes we had,

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:54.730
DT and Ecarlate died a little too easily.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.150
One could simply claim 
that Erec-sama was simply

00:02:57.150 --> 00:03:00.280
so strong that a single strike 
was enough to finish DT, but

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.840
something wasn't quite right.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.290
"That's why I felt it was necessary

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:08.000
to observe the other two for a while."

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.150
How do you know what I was thinking?

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:15.950
Gustave, you should try 
to control your habit

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.600
of thinking out loud.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.360
What was supposed to be an

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.070
inner monologue was anything but.

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:22.870
Really?

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:23.750
Really.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.920
KT, what do you think?

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:30.890
You think I'm overthinking this?

00:03:32.510 --> 00:03:37.370
If DT is alive, he's sure 
to rejoin the targets.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.890
This plan is quite sound.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:45.920
But I think there's another reason 
that you proposed this plan.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:46.530
What?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.210
Don't play dumb,

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:52.250
I know that Marquesas is 
famous for its pretty women.

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:55.500
You're here for the hostess clubs!

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.370
D-Don't be silly!

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:01.050
Who do you think I am?!

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.440
"I love hostess clubs" Gustave.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.720
No! What I love is what's 
after, and accompaniment!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.550
That's still the same thing.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.940
Just remember this.

00:04:10.940 --> 00:04:13.420
I'm here to watch you.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:15.710
Make sure to not forget your mission.

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:18.230
Don't underestimate me.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.390
Did you really think I 
wouldn't do anything when

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.220
there are girls with smooth 
white skin waiting for me?

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:26.490
Were you even listening to me?!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:43.380
Mission log, day 2, 10:32.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.380
 Day 2, 10:32

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:44.670
Log entry by

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:47.530
Incognito's 3rd division 
commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:54.620
At present, the targets aren't 
doing anything noteworthy.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:59.520
However, I can't believe that the 
targets will just sit around idly.

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:03.440
It's certain that they're 
going to do something.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.460
But Gustave was thinking,

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.170
"Oh man, I wish the mission 
was over so I could

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.190
caress the smooth skin of 
some girl's upper arm."

00:05:11.190 --> 00:05:12.610
That's quite true.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.410
However, KT wasn't letting him do that.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:19.890
But Gustave was actually 
sneaking out at night.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.260
However, touching wasn't allowed.

00:05:22.260 --> 00:05:26.470
But it was impossible for Gustave 
to stop longing for smooth skin.

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:28.240
However, KT had decided to 
stop him even if it would take

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.640
putting a rope around his neck.

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:30.760
But!

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:31.390
However!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.370
But!

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.140
However!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.320
Hey, can you cut it out already?

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:37.340
Where's the harm in me 
going to a hostess club?!

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.940
As long as I do my work

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.700
what's the problem with that?!

00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:41.640
They're moving!

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:45.280
So they're finally making a move.

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:46.570
What do you make of this?

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.840
I'm sure they don't know 
that we're watching them.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:50.820
Which means...

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:52.860
That they have no reason 
to not meet with

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:54.450
DT and the princess if 
they're still alive.

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.290
Let's follow them. Don't be seen.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.000
Mission log, day 2, 12:04.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.960
Day 2, 12:04

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:06.590
Currently targets Alpha and 
Bravo are moving together.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.000
Judging from their strides, 
they have a destination.

00:06:10.440 --> 00:06:12.250
We will continue shadowing them.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.360
I'll follow the woman.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.440
Hey!

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.360
Oh well.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.440
Meeting at a café downtown, huh?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.560
I guess this is the real deal.

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:57.200
Just as I thought, 
DT is not dead at all.

00:07:03.720 --> 00:07:04.660
Is that him?!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:08.820
Now, show yourself, DT!

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.810
That's just some old dude!

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.250
Damn them for misleading me.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.630
Wait a second. Who is that guy?

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.420
When did they contact him?

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.140
And how did they set up this meeting?

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:29.670
We never left our targets unattended.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.480
Wait, calm down.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:34.370
It's simple to make someone 
set up an appointment.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.820
What's important is to 
find out who he is,

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.630
and to find out if he's connected to DT.

00:07:42.880 --> 00:07:44.990
Money and a note...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.270
Even more suspicious.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:57.580
Who to follow now?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.620
Of course, that one.

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.480
Fog...

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.800
Oh no you don't!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:30.150
This is...

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.060
Anything?

00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.480
Kind of.

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:43.500
The targets are both back.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.530
Target Alpha met with a man.

00:08:46.530 --> 00:08:48.380
I followed the man, but...

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:49.650
But?

00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:52.300
I lost him.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:53.340
Fool.

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.700
Whatever. And you?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:56.680
Shopping.

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:01.070
Clothes, shoes, flowers, 
and much more.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:03.700
I watched the interactions 
with the store clerks,

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:05.500
and I examined the stores,

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.230
but there was nothing suspicious.

00:09:07.660 --> 00:09:09.450
So that was a dud.

00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:10.790
And you screwed up.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:13.470
That means...

00:09:25.490 --> 00:09:27.340
You don't seem happy.

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:32.760
Are you talking to 
yourself in the mirror?

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.450
I know.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:38.860
That empty feeling left in your 
heart when a rival is gone.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:42.250
When there's no more tension, 
your hands feel too idle.

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:45.390
That's a completely normal 
reaction for a fighter.

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:46.810
Nope.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:50.940
I just had work shoved onto 
me by this paranoid twosome.

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:54.140
No need to be ashamed, Variation.

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:56.070
I think you should have 
a little more shame.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:02.280
I mean, even Erec-sama seems to 
almost look a little lonely.

00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:17.170
Mission log, day 3, 08:13.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.170
Day 3, 08:13

00:10:17.490 --> 00:10:18.500
Log entry by

00:10:18.500 --> 00:10:21.350
Incognito's 3rd division 
commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:24.150
At present, target 
Alpha and target Bravo

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.350
are in the same room, conversing.

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:27.430
We will continue the observation.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.980
Hey, woman! Take me to a hostess club!

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.980
No. Why do I have to take you?

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:36.450
You talking back to me?!

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:38.570
If you are seriously 
not going to take me,

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.970
I'll stuff all your pockets 
full of potato starch!

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:44.590
Whatever. Even if you did go,

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:47.330
you'd just come home 
after they scalp you.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.210
Don't be ridiculous!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.850
I am a veteran with a proven record!

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:54.310
By my own count, I have a 
78% post-club success rate.

00:10:54.310 --> 00:10:56.210
Don't underestimate my genius 
chatting skills and gumption!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:00.220
By your own count means 
it's all made up.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.910
That's not important right now!

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:05.110
What's important right now is

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.680
that I want to go to a hostess club!

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.100
Nope.

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:13.480
Damn it!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:17.230
Mission log, day 3, 13:33.

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.230
Day 3, 13:33

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.120
No noteworthy movements 
by the targets.

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:36.120
The only change would 
be that target Alpha

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.300
has started giving food to cats

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:44.440
and that target 
Bravo is... Bravo!

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:45.010
Hey!

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:47.150
That's enough.

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.220
Any more of that and you're 
just a peeping tom.

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:51.520
A little would be fi—

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.140
No!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.230
But just...

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:54.210
Down!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.650
Okay.

00:11:57.350 --> 00:12:00.280
Mission log, day 3, 19:32.

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.280
Day 3, 19:32

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:04.990
No noteworthy movements 
by the targets.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.040
Hey, can I leave this post to you?

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.790
You can't go to a hostess club.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.500
I'm going to investigate.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:14.780
At a hostess club?

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:19.580
No, I'm going to look for 
the man I lost yesterday.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.180
Hostess club, then.

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:27.680
Mission log, day 3, 20:02.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.680
Day 3, 20:02

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:31.670
Log entry by Incognito's 3rd 
division commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:12:32.090 --> 00:12:37.060
Dubbing the man who met with 
target Alpha target Charlie.

00:12:37.510 --> 00:12:39.940
Beginning the investigation to 
find out where Charlie went.

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:43.990
After a thorough investigation 
of places he went,

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:47.780
I am moving to point N358 
after getting a tip

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:50.540
that important information 
about Charlie is waiting there.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:53.310
The name of the new 
investigation target is:

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:56.200
I'm Carina!

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.250
While asking about her age, profession,

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.170
place of residence, 
dreams for the future,

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:00.550
Cheers!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.550
I permit the consumption of a drink.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.050
I'm beginning the true interrogation.

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:07.760
Interrogation? I'm so nervous!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.010
Day 3, 22:28

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.010
Mission log, day 3, 22:28.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:14.520
After a harsh interrogation and 
payment of the naming fee,

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.940
I was able to glean information about

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:19.060
her measurements and the 
presence/absence of a boyfriend.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.860
You're talking to yourself again.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.320
After getting initial results,

00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.530
I decide to press on 
with the interrogation.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:26.200
What? Then let's have another drink!

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:31.580
M-Mission log, 23:12?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.490
Day 3, 23:12?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.500
I don't know what's going on.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.500
I decide to sleep.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:46.260
Mission log, day 4, 10:08.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:46.260
Day 4, 10:08

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.390
Log entry by Incognito's 3rd 
division commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:54.100
Ugh, I feel sick. Scratch that.

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:57.100
At present, no change in the targets.

00:13:57.650 --> 00:14:01.570
For an unknown reason, 
I do not feel 100%.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:03.280
For some reason,

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.900
the right side of the 
back of my head throbs.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.820
Do you honestly need to 
think about the reason?!

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:11.990
Listen up, maggot!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:14.500
Today you're going to watch them!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:16.000
Got that?!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.500
Y-Yes.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:22.710
Mission log, day 4, 11:03.

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.710
Day 4, 11:03

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.220
No noteworthy actions by the targets.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.680
Mission log, day 4, 15:22.

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:29.680
Day 4, 15:22

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.220
No noteworthy actions by the targets.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:35.560
Day 4, 18:00

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.560
18:00.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.830
No noteworthy actions 
by the targets, huh?

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:45.570
What's going on here?!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.150
It's already day four.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:52.200
Any developments?

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:56.450
Same old. At present, 
nothing is notewor—

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.450
Except now!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:14:59.160
Bravo went outside!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.250
I'll leave this to you!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:01.670
Hey!

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:08.340
A meeting at night.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.220
You finally grew impatient 
and made your move.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.720
Now, take me to DT.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.530
I've scoped out the place.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.620
You can't get out from the bathroom.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:38.910
The back door goes into the kitchen.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:41.040
The bartender does not seem suspicious.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.290
Now we just need to wait 
for the guests to come.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:55.010
Damn you, seductress, how much 
do you plan on drinking?

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:56.890
Another one please.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:15:58.640
<i>You're going to have more?!</i>

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.350
What's wrong with her?

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.730
Stupid, sexy, masochist, and 
she can drink like a fish.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.780
This is bad. I'm getting sleepy!

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:14.930
This is nuts.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:16.470
If I had known, I would have asked for

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:18.600
yesterday's drinks to 
be extra watered down!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.040
Another one please.

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.120
<i>What?</i>

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:25.500
Excuse me, another one please.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:28.090
<i>Damn this heavyweight!</i>

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:31.510
<i>I'm on day two here!</i>

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:42.640
<i>At this rate I'm going 
to lose this match.</i>

00:16:47.900 --> 00:16:49.610
<i>What am I going to do?</i>

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.650
<i>I did quite well until now.</i>

00:16:51.650 --> 00:16:56.070
<i>If I go down now, one could say 
that I died honorably in battle.</i>

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:59.030
<i>To be honest, I just want 
to lie down right now!</i>

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.830
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.830
<i>But if I sleep now and 
something fun happens,</i>

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.630
<i>I'd be pissed.</i>

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:14.130
Mind if I sit here?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.640
Don't ask after you sit down.

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:20.050
What are you doing here?

00:17:20.610 --> 00:17:21.600
I could ask the same.

00:17:22.110 --> 00:17:24.610
Put the gun away, 
I didn't come to fight.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:29.610
I guess you have no more 
reason to fight, but...

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:32.000
But you have all the 
more reason? Maybe.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.150
Not really.

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:36.660
We failed.

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:41.020
We couldn't save our friends

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:42.700
and we couldn't protect 
the life of our leader

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.720
that was supposed to be more 
important than our own.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.790
All we could do is bite our fingers

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.920
and watch the last moments of our leader.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.050
For us, there's no reason left to fight.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.010
Don't take it personally, 
it's work for us, too.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:59.740
Jeez, you men.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:03.270
Forgetting etiquette for now, 
will you tell me one more thing?

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:06.230
What are you doing here?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.850
Can't you see? Drinking.

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.610
Not that. What I mean is—

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.400
There's barely anything 
left that we can do.

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.820
We're just trying to do 
one of those things.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.240
Whether you guys 
are watching or not,

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.630
we are going to do what we can.

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:24.500
That's all.

00:18:25.120 --> 00:18:27.410
Sheesh, why do women have to talk

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.670
in such a complicated 
manner all the time?

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:32.460
The wife that left me did that, too.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.150
Women are not such simple creatures

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.300
that they would reveal all 
their secrets so easily.

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:38.130
You'd do well to remember that.

00:18:41.410 --> 00:18:42.300
I'm going home.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.390
Oh, and this is your treat, right?

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:48.330
Huh? I guess.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:49.610
Oh and...

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.690
Since you guys piss me off,

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:55.940
I'll just take this one shot. 
That's okay, right?

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.900
See ya.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.660
You ask after you hit me?

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:10.580
Are you sure?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:12.720
Leaving without any real results?

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.710
DT didn't appear after all this time.

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.300
And if we stick around 
here for much longer,

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.430
who knows what Variation 
will say to us.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:25.680
You really think we 
can trust that woman?

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:29.270
I didn't really understand 
what she was saying,

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:31.550
but it didn't seem like she was lying.

00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:34.800
No wonder they always pull one 
over you in the cabarets.

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:37.190
Women are an order of magnitude 
better at lying than men.

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:40.400
She said the same thing...

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.660
<i>Whether you guys 
are watching or not...</i>

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:45.440
What's wrong?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.290
She'd noticed!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:48.040
What?

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:49.960
I was alone then.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.830
But she said "you guys."

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:55.740
So she knew about the tail all along?

00:19:58.710 --> 00:19:59.480
It's no use.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:00.670
They're both gone!

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:06.140
They got us.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:06.880
Damn.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:07.850
Let's hurry, KT.

00:20:08.490 --> 00:20:10.310
Go? Where? Do you have some idea?

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.940
I don't have proof.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.510
But if her plan is to dodge 
us and meet up with DT,

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:21.070
that old guy has something 
to do with it for sure.

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.220
If they're going to meet,

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.240
it'll be in that one 
place with no witnesses.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:26.530
It all fits.

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.290
I know DT's over there.

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.310
This is...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.870
Our leader.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.580
Our friends.

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:21.420
Though your mortal bodies 
may be destroyed,

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:24.260
your souls live on in our hearts.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:27.510
We will keep your souls 
in our memories.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:37.060
We shall live on as 
your flesh and blood.

00:21:42.840 --> 00:21:46.330
Those you left behind 
will never forget you.

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.960
We swear that we will 
inherit that devotion

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.660
and carve it into our hearts,

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:53.330
so that we may continue 
to walk on together.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:57.250
Farewell, Princess,

00:21:57.660 --> 00:21:58.230
Kon.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:09.800
Mission log, day 5, 16:07.

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:13.970
Day 5, 16:07

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:13.970
Log entry by Incognito's 3rd 
division commander Gustave Gustaf.

00:22:14.850 --> 00:22:17.560
We have confirmed the deaths 
of DT and Ecarlate.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.900
Thus, this mission has concluded.

00:22:33.290 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>We swear that we will continue 
to walk on together.</i>

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:20.890
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:14.140
Thank you for enjoying <i>Ixion Saga DT</i>.

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:17.150
Due to the death of the main character,

00:24:17.150 --> 00:24:19.180
this will be the last episode.

00:24:19.590 --> 00:24:20.890
Starting with the next episode,

00:24:20.890 --> 00:24:24.400
<i>Ixion Saga ED</i> will be starting, 
so please look forward to it.

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:24.900
<b>(This is his personal wish.)</b>

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:35.330
Hokaze Kon,

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:35.330
rest in peace.
